# This file sets the Node version for mise, and for Cloudflare Pages when it
# builds the website (through the /web/.node-version symlink).
#
# It should be equal to Wasp's lowest supported Node version.
# Keep in sync with:
# - The compiler (Wasp.Node.Version).
# - The docs: /docs/introduction/quick-start.md ("Requirements" section).
# - The docs plugin: /web/src/remark/search-and-replace.ts
# - The web package: /web/package.json
# - The published packages of the pnpm workspace, and /scripts/make-npm-packages/templates/sub-package/package.json
# - The embedded packages: /packages/*/package.json
# (Also just grep for the version in case we forgot somewhere.)
